        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Accordingly, we believe that such business are in full compliance with all applicable laws and regulations governing the administration and restructuring of state-owned assets, although we are currently unable to obtain copies of certain filing and approval documents from our partners due to their internal confidentiality constraints.",
        "start_character": 381260,
