        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-023822",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Both clinical stage and commercial drug product have completed technology transfer, and we expect to manufacture substantially all drug products in Shanghai facility in the future.",
        "start_character": 31434,
        "end_character": 31614
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-023822",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-023822-a6e3d6652c94ac30",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-023822",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, because of the extensive time required for clinical development and regulatory review of a drug candidate we may develop, it is possible that, before any of our drug candidates can be commercialized, any related patent may expire or remain in force for only a short period following commercialization, thereby limiting protection such patent would afford the respective product and any competitive advantage such patent may provide.",
        "start_character": 231722,
        "end_character": 232167
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-023822",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-023822-a6e3d6652c94ac30",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-023822",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we expect to progress some of our drug candidates by pursuing business development opportunities with other biopharmaceutical companies in China such as our collaborations to evaluate combining fruquintinib with anti-PD-1 antibodies for the treatment of various solid tumor cancers.",
        "start_character": 12183,
        "end_character": 12478
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-023822",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-023822-a6e3d6652c94ac30",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-023822",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Many of our competitors, either alone or with their strategic partners, have substantially greater financial, technical and human resources than we do and significantly greater experience in the discovery and development of drug candidates, obtaining regulatory approvals of products and the commercialization of those products.",
        "start_character": 182442,
        "end_character": 182770
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-023822",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-023822-a6e3d6652c94ac30",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-023822",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Since 2001, we have also developed drug marketing and distribution platforms in China, which primarily focus on prescription drug and healthcare products through several subsidiary companies and are included in our Other Ventures.",
        "start_character": 962,
        "end_character": 1192
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-023822",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-023822-a6e3d6652c94ac30",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-023822",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-05",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We consolidate as revenue approximately 70-80% of Elunate in-market sales from manufacturing revenue, promotion and marketing services and royalties paid to us by Lilly.",
        "start_character": 15025,
        "end_character": 15194
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-023822",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-023822-a6e3d6652c94ac30",
